  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 11c0f7c906d6409449e122b8bb29dd29, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteReader
  prompt: Read note
  title: A note, scrawled in pencil
  body: 'If you''re reading this you got further than I did.


    The exit key hangs
    under the great bell. The blades swing on their own schedule. Don''t rush them.
    Watch, wait for the gap, then go.


    They took my notes. They don''t want
    anyone knowing what Cross built up here.'
